-# Legendary Dark Knight Mode 3.11.0 (x2 / x3 / x4, with Boss Invasion)
+# Legendary Dark Knight Mode 3.13.0 (with Boss Invasion)
+
+## 3.13: fill every eligible encounter
+
+There is now one LDK, not x2/x3/x4 variants. Every eligible encounter gets as
+many reinforcements as fit its 12-entry capacity and the eight-clone hook
+budget, everywhere rather than only in Goro's Lair. Each authored enemy's
+copies stay together. The heap guard admits only enemies whose memory is spare
+after every authored spawn, and the character-pool gate holds the rest until
+there is room. The fatality tutorial remains vanilla.
+
+## 3.12: complete each enemy's set first
+
+Reinforcements now complete one eligible authored enemy's x2/x3/x4 set before
+moving to the next, instead of repeating the whole group in identical waves.
+For x3, the first enemy's two clones come first, then the next enemy's two.
+Group sizes, the Goro's Lair fill, and all memory and character-pool rules are
+unchanged.
 
 ## 3.11: Goro's Lair fills its groups
 
